# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 2 and Appendix B (`Len` of a text counts its bytes): "café €😀A" is 3 + 2 + 1 + 3 + 4 + 1 = 14 bytes; λ places as itself twice; `?CharOf` gives λ for 955 and nil for a surrogate and past 10FFFF, each nil placed as `-`.
